@Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5127

### Health Check - Liveness
GET {{Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress}}/employees/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Health Check - Readiness
GET {{Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress}}/employees/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Get Employee Profile
GET {{Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/employee-profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Get Departments
GET {{Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/departments
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Get Leave Requests
GET {{Maliev.EmployeeService.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/leave
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

###
